  "details": "# Issue:\nSometimes you don't want Avatar Touch Haptics to be on all the time and just want to Quickly turn it on / off. This is not possible any more because the settings for it have moved to the Main Menu\n# Suggestion:\nAdd a Avatar Touch Haptics Toggle to the Avatar Interactions section of the Quick Menu Settings Tab. That way you can easily turn it on / off without it requiring a separate category and since they are related to each other I think putting it in there would be fine.\nThis would make it easier to just quickly turn it on / off without always having to go to the Main Menu.",
